le Now"}], "content": "<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55\">Free, no commitment. We will walk through your situation and confirm whether we are a fit.</p>", "content_color": {"color": "#333333", "opacity": 100}, "content_size": 17, "css_class": "dnd-module", "eyebrow": "", "headline": "Schedule a 30-minute consultation.", "headline_lh": "1.25", "headline_size": 32, "max_width": 720, "module_id": 218940115731, "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#E6E5E3", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_6", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_6", "name": "module_6", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_id": 218944099156}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_7", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_7", "name": "module_7", "params": {"answer_size": 15, "css_class": "dnd-module", "headline_lh": "normal", "headline_size": 32, "items": [{"answer": "Private label uses our existing formulations with your brand on the label. Contract manufacturing typically refers to producing to your specifications (your formulation, your packaging, your everything). We do both. Most clients start with private label and add contract manufacturing as they grow.", "question": "What's the difference between private label and contract manufacturing?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Our R&D team has developed hundreds of supplement formulations across most major categories. We work from your concept (or just your audience pain point) through formulation, stability testing, scale-up, and production.", "question": "Can you handle custom formulations from concept to production?"}, {"answer": "Your formula is your IP. We document it in a way that you own and could (in theory) take to another manufacturer. We don't claim ownership over formulations we develop for clients.", "question": "How does intellectual property work with custom formulations?"}, {"answer": "Custom formulation has higher minimums than private label, typically in the low thousands of bottles per SKU. The exact number depends on the formulation complexity and packaging. We give you specific numbers during scoping.", "question": "What's the minimum production run for contract manufacturing?"}, {"answer": "12 to 16 weeks from project kickoff to first production run. The timeline includes formulation development, ingredient sourcing, stability testing, manufacturing scale-up, and first batch production. Faster is possible for simpler formulations.", "question": "How long do contract manufacturing projects typically take?"}], "max_width": 820, "module_id": 218940115739, "open_first": false, "question_size": 17, "section_eyebrow": "", "section_headline": "Frequently asked questions", "section_subhead": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; line-height: 27px\">None</p>", "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#F7F7F6", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_8", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_8", "name": "module_8", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_